From: SkiffOS <skiffos@skiffos.com>
Date: Mon, 24 Mar 2026 21:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] lib: initcall: enable debug tracing to diagnose init hang

U-Boot on sun5i/R8 hangs silently after "DRAM: 512 MiB".  Enable
initcall debug output so that each function's address is printed
before it runs.  The last address printed identifies the hanging
function — look it up in u-boot.map.

This is a temporary diagnostic patch.  Remove once the hang is found.

Signed-off-by: SkiffOS <skiffos@skiffos.com>
---
 lib/initcall.c | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/lib/initcall.c b/lib/initcall.c
--- a/lib/initcall.c
+++ b/lib/initcall.c
@@ -1,4 +1,6 @@
 // SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0+
+/* Enable initcall tracing — temporary diagnostic for sun5i hang */
+#define DEBUG
 /*
